        "id": 1884477
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-31T17:25:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case I think it is more appropriate to remove the specific asserts that have been triggered by Floss, and replace them with manual (not check_that) checks + error logs.\n\nIf an assert is used to check a controller behavior, then we must make sure that the behavior is standard.",
      "parentUuid": "22853a1f_cd105e36",
      "revId": "3f4f7faa5ad084e7aa7f65ffdfa86a313bc42d6f",
